==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{confix|en|hyper|opia}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|pathology}} A disorder of the vision where the eye [[focus]]es images behind the [[retina]] instead of on it, so that distant objects can be seen better than near objects.
#: {{ant|en|myopia}}

